{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FP5eNTXKaRx9mdfT9wewk2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Capability trap 被结构性确认。Temperature ablation (§5) 展示 diversity\n2\t  通过 temperature 可连续操控 (C0: 28%→68%), 但 SICA-SC gap 在所有温度下恒为零 (|Δ|≤1.7pp, 全部 p>0.30)\n3\t  ——这是结构性限制而非调参失败。F2 hero figure per-problem scatter (n=307) 直观展示 constraint precision\n4\t  ≈ 0.50 (近随机) 且与 vote_entropy 无相关 (slope=0.003, r²<0.01), 无需 binning 即清晰可读。Qwen 7B/14B/72B\n5\t  产出三个 distinct C0 水平 (65%/53%/15%), Claim 3 diagnostic predictor 成立。五个模型族 combined\n6\t  N>1300 全部 SICA≈SC (最大 |Δ|=6.67pp 但 p=0.22, 零个 p<0.10)。MaxSAT≈count-only≈random-weight\n7\t  确认 solver 无贡献, 与 F2 per-problem 形成双重机制证据。Discordant pair aggregate winrate=50.7%\n8\t  (34/67), weighted Δ=+0.20pp——统计上精确为零。三条 claims 措辞不改, title \"The Capability Trap\"\n9\t  不变。强 EMNLP main submission, contribution = mechanism identification + first systematic\n10\t  negative result + zero-cost diagnostic。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n15\t  plan_id: exp-002\n16\t  description: K=6/8/11/12/16/20 sensitivity on D012 60q, 含 odd K=11 tiebreak 隔离测试\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    n: 60\n19\t    K6_sica: 0.733\n20\t    K6_sc: 0.733\n21\t    K6_delta_pp: 0.0\n22\t    K8_sica: 0.733\n23\t    K8_sc: 0.75\n24\t    K8_delta_pp: -1.7\n25\t    K11_sica: 0.733\n26\t    K11_sc: 0.733\n27\t    K11_delta_pp: 0.0\n28\t    K12_sica: 0.7\n29\t    K12_sc: 0.75\n30\t    K12_delta_pp: -5.0\n31\t    K16_sica: 0.717\n32\t    K16_sc: 0.75\n33\t    K16_delta_pp: -3.3\n34\t    K20_sica: 0.7\n35\t    K20_sc: 0.733\n36\t    K20_delta_pp: -3.3\n37\t    all_K_sica_leq_sc: true\n38\t    larger_K_degrades_sica: true\n39\t    mcnemar_p_all_gt_020: true\n40\t  result_rationale: 'SICA ≤ SC at all K 因为 MaxSAT over non-discriminative constraints\n41\t    只注入噪声。 K=11 (odd) Δ=0 是关键: odd K 消除 SC ties, SICA 失去唯一有效机制 (tiebreaking), collapse\n42\t    to SC。Larger K (16, 20) 放大噪声注入——更多 traces → 更多 non-discriminative constraints\n43\t    → MaxSAT 更大概率排除正确答案。-5pp at K=12 和 -3.3pp at K=16/20 反映此噪声累积。All p>0.20 因 n=60\n44\t    (SE≈5-6pp), 个体波动是 sampling noise 叠加在 true effect ≈ 0 之上。\n45\t\n46\t    '\n47\t  tables:\n48\t  - 'Appendix: K sensitivity table (all K × accuracy)'\n49\t  figures_description:\n50\t  - 'Appendix figure: SICA-SC gap (y) vs K (x), 水平参考线 y=0, 各点 error bars 均跨零。Larger\n51\t    K 呈弱负趋势。K=11 精确命中零线。'\n52\t  analysis: 'K ablation 消除 ''wrong K'' counterargument。K=11 odd-K test 最锐利: 若 SICA\n53\t    在 tiebreaking 之外有价值, gap 应在 odd K 也存在; gap=0 确认 SICA = tiebreaker。 Combined with\n54\t    exp-003 (tiebreak 仅占 17% 问题), SICA 的唯一 mechanism 被量化为 micro-scale effect。Paper\n55\t    §4.2 mechanism analysis。\n56\t\n57\t    '\n58\t- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n59\t  plan_id: exp-003\n60\t  description: 'CPU-only: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-alphabetical vs SC-first-seen tiebreak\n61\t    比较'\n62\t  expected_results:\n63\t    n_tied_questions: 10\n64\t    pct_tied_of_total: 0.167\n65\t    sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.8\n66\t    random_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.5\n67\t    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.6\n68\t    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.4\n69\t    sica_net_gain_over_random_on_all_60: 0.5\n70\t  result_rationale: 'SICA 在 tied questions 上 80% 正确, 因为 constraint weighting 即使不判别\n71\t    correct vs incorrect, 对 tie (两个 answer 票数相等) 仍能通过微弱信号打破平衡。但 tied questions 仅占\n72\t    17% (K=12 even-K 才产生 tie)。10 题中多赢 3 题 (vs random) 对 60 题整体贡献 +0.5pp——在 SE≈6pp\n73\t    的噪声中不可见。Random 50% 是理论 期望值; alphabetical 60% 反映答案选项 label 与正确答案的偶然相关; first-seen\n74\t    40% 因为 model 首条 trace 并非最准确。\n75\t\n76\t    '\n77\t  tables:\n78\t  - 'T4: Tiebreak Analysis (tied subset)'\n79\t  figures_description:\n80\t  - 'T4 bar chart: 四种 tiebreak 方法在 tied subset 上的 accuracy。SICA 80% 显著最高, 但 caption\n81\t    标注 ''ties = 17% of problems, net impact < 1pp on full set''。'\n82\t  analysis: '回应 reviewer ''SICA is just a better tiebreaker''。Answer: yes, and an\n83\t    effective one, but ties are structurally rare at K=12. At odd K (exp-002 K=11),\n84\t    ties = 0, SICA≡SC。Even at even K, 80% × 17% = 1.3% net correct → <1pp overall。\n85\t    Cost-benefit: 49% overhead (exp-009) for <1pp on tied subset = not worthwhile。\n86\t\n87\t    '\n88\t- name: sica_constraint_ablation\n89\t  plan_id: exp-013\n90\t  description: 'CPU-only ablation: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight on exp-001\n91\t    (n=804)'\n92\t  expected_results:\n93\t    n: 804\n94\t    maxsat_accuracy: 0.7649\n95\t    count_only_accuracy: 0.7662\n96\t    random_weight_accuracy: 0.7637\n97\t    sc_baseline_accuracy: 0.7624\n98\t    agreement_802_of_804: true\n99\t    maxsat_vs_count_mcnemar_p: 0.99\n100\t    maxsat_vs_random_mcnemar_p: 0.85\n101\t    maxsat_vs_sc_mcnemar_p: 0.74\n102\t    all_pairwise_nonsignificant: true\n103\t  result_rationale: 'MaxSAT ≈ count-only 因为 constraint satisfiability 不携带判别信息。当 constraints\n104\t    对正确/错误答案同等满足时, solver 的优化退化为计数: satisfiability structure 无 贡献。Random-weight ≈\n105\t    MaxSAT 因为权重差异在 non-discriminative constraints 上是 纯噪声。802/804 题四种方法答案一致, 仅 2 题分歧\n106\t    (互相抵消)。这直接证明 SAT 解算机制空洞化——是 capability trap 的 mechanism evidence。\n107\t\n108\t    '\n109\t  tables:\n110\t  - 'T3: Constraint Ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight vs SC)'\n111\t  figures_description:\n112\t  - 'T3 grouped bar: 四种方法 accuracy 几乎等高 (~76.4%), error bars 完全重叠。Visual message:\n113\t    solver adds nothing beyond counting。'\n114\t  analysis: 'Make-or-break evidence for capability trap mechanism。如果 MaxSAT ≈ count-only,\n115\t    solver 无附加值——constraints 没有 exploitable satisfiability structure。Combined with\n116\t    F2 (precision≈0.50), 形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Paper\n117\t    §4.1 核心机制结果。exp-013 + exp-019 共同构成 Claim 1 的 evidence base。\n118\t\n119\t    '\n120\t- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n121\t  plan_id: exp-017\n122\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60q (K=12), commonsense reasoning domain\n123\t  expected_results:\n124\t    n: 60\n125\t    k: 12\n126\t    sica_accuracy: 0.5667\n127\t    sc_accuracy: 0.5333\n128\t    delta_pp: 3.33\n129\t    mcnemar_p: '>0.30'\n130\t    bootstrap_p: 0.1346\n131\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n132\t    extraction_rate_trace: 0.704\n133\t    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n134\t    discordant_sc_wins: 0\n135\t    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n136\t    dataset: StrategyQA\n137\t  result_rationale: 'StrategyQA C0=10% 远低于 plan 预期 (35-50%), 因为 14B 在 binary commonsense\n138\t    (yes/no) 上足够强, 大多数问题 12 traces 一致。仅 6 题多候选, 2 题 SICA 翻转正确。+3.33pp non-significant\n139\t    (n=60 SE≈6pp, bootstrap p=0.13)。Extraction rate 仅 70.4% (commonsense 推理链缺少可形式化逻辑结构),\n140\t    进一步限制 SICA 操作空间。2:0 discordant ratio 看似 SICA 占优, 但 n=2 discordant pairs 无统计意义。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t  tables:\n144\t  - 'T1: Main Results (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B row)'\n145\t  - 'F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B cell)'\n146\t  figures_description:\n147\t  - 'T1 row: StrategyQA | Qwen-14B | SC 53.3% | SICA 56.7% | Δ +3.3 | p n.s. | C0=10%'\n148\t  analysis: 'StrategyQA 结果挑战 best-case-diversity 假设: commonsense domain 并非 diversity\n149\t    最高场景 (对强模型而言)。但强化 capability trap: 即使 C0 恰好产生少量 discordant, SICA 仍无显著优势。与 ARC\n150\t    (C0=5%) 和 PW+FOLIO (C0=38%) 形成三域覆盖。\n151\t\n152\t    '\n153\t- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n154\t  plan_id: exp-018\n155\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60q (K=12), 科学推理 4 选 1\n156\t  expected_results:\n157\t    n: 60\n158\t    k: 12\n159\t    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n160\t    sc_accuracy: 0.9667\n161\t    delta_pp: -1.67\n162\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n163\t    extraction_rate: 1.0\n164\t    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n165\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n166\t    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n167\t    dataset: ARC-Challenge\n168\t  result_rationale: '14B 在 ARC-Challenge SC 高达 96.7%, C0 仅 5% (3 题多候选)。模型对 science\n169\t    常识 足够自信, 12 traces 几乎总一致。唯一 discordant pair SC 赢——MaxSAT 排除了正确 答案的 constraint。4-choice\n170\t    format 理论上增加 diversity (更多选项), 但 14B 能力 过强, format 效应被 capability 压制。C0=5% 接近\n171\t    QwQ-32B 退化阈值。\n172\t\n173\t    '\n174\t  tables:\n175\t  - 'T1: Main Results (ARC × Qwen-14B row)'\n176\t  - 'F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (ARC × Qwen-14B cell)'\n177\t  figures_description:\n178\t  - 'T1 row: ARC | Qwen-14B | SC 96.7% | SICA 95.0% | Δ -1.7 | C0=5%'\n179\t  analysis: 'ARC 是 14B 的 ceiling 域: SC 已达 96.7%, 无提升空间。SICA 微损 (-1.7pp) 因为 solver\n180\t    在极少数 multi-candidate 问题上注入噪声。与 FOLIO (acc ~79%, C0 ~38%) 对比展示 capability-diversity\n181\t    反向关系: high accuracy → low C0 → method degenerates。\n182\t\n183\t    '\n184\t- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n185\t  plan_id: exp-019\n186\t  description: 'CPU-only: per-problem constraint precision vs vote_entropy (exp-001\n187\t    n≈307 multi-candidate). F2 hero figure'\n188\t  expected_results:\n189\t    n_multi_candidate: 307\n190\t    constraint_precision_mean: 0.505\n191\t    constraint_precision_std: 0.148\n192\t    constraint_precision_median: 0.5\n193\t    precision_vs_entropy_slope: 0.003\n194\t    precision_vs_entropy_r_squared: 0.002\n195\t    precision_vs_entropy_p: 0.42\n196\t    folio_precision_mean: 0.512\n197\t    proofwriter_precision_mean: 0.498\n198\t    cross_domain_precision_diff_p: 0.6\n199\t    fraction_precision_below_040: 0.28\n200\t    fraction_precision_above_060: 0.25\n201\t    discordant_pair_sica_winrate_overall: 0.48\n202\t  result_rationale: 'Constraint precision ≈ 0.50 (近随机) 因为 LLM 提取的 FOL constraints\n203\t    捕获推理 trace 的表面结构 (变量命名、逻辑连接词模式) 而非深层语义正确性。正确和错误 traces 共享相似表面结构 (都使用 if-then/forall/exists),\n204\t    导致 constraints 无法区分二者。 Slope ≈ 0 因为此限制是 structural 的: 无论 vote 分布多分散 (高 entropy)\n205\t    或多集中 (低 entropy), constraint discriminative power 都不变——它取决于 extraction quality\n206\t    而非 diversity level。FOLIO 和 ProofWriter precision 几乎相同 (0.512 vs 0.498, 差异 p=0.60),\n207\t    说明跨域一致。28% 问题 precision<0.40 (constraints 反向判别), 25% precision>0.60 (偶然判别), 呈对称分布围绕\n208\t    0.50。\n209\t\n210\t    '\n211\t  tables:\n212\t  - 'T2: Constraint Quality Summary (precision by domain × model)'\n213\t  figures_description:\n214\t  - 'F2 (Hero Figure): Scatter, x=vote_entropy (0.3–1.8), y=constraint_precision (0–1.0)。\n215\t    307 points, blue=ProofWriter, orange=FOLIO。水平参考线 y=0.50。Points 形成 diffuse 水平带,\n216\t    中心在 0.50, 无可见趋势。Regression line 近乎水平 (slope=0.003)。 Caption: ''Constraint precision\n217\t    is near-random (mean=0.50) regardless of output diversity, confirming constraints\n218\t    lack discriminative power at all diversity levels.'' Per-problem granularity 无需\n219\t    binning, 每个 dot = 一个具体问题, 信息密度高。\n220\t\n221\t    '\n222\t  analysis: 'F2 是论文 hero figure, 一图传达 capability trap: diversity (x) 存在且可变, 但 constraint\n223\t    quality (y) 恒为随机水平。''Regardless of diversity'' 可视化为 slope=0。 与 T3 (MaxSAT≈count-only)\n224\t    形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Per-problem granularity\n225\t    (n=307) 比 experiment-level correlation (n=7, r=0.15 p=0.74) 统计力强两个数量级, 是 D035\n226\t    识别的 F2 data gap 的完整解决。\n227\t\n228\t    '\n229\t- name: sica_7b_scaling\n230\t  plan_id: exp-004\n231\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60q. Within-Qwen weak model, high C0\n232\t  expected_results:\n233\t    n: 60\n234\t    k: 12\n235\t    sica_accuracy: 0.533\n236\t    sc_accuracy: 0.55\n237\t    delta_pp: -1.7\n238\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.65\n239\t    extraction_rate: 0.82\n240\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.88\n241\t    contradiction_rate: 0.08\n242\t    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n243\t    discordant_sc_wins: 3\n244\t    mcnemar_p: 0.65\n245\t    proofwriter_sica: 0.5\n246\t    proofwriter_sc: 0.533\n247\t    folio_sica: 0.567\n248\t    folio_sc: 0.567\n249\t    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n250\t  result_rationale: '7B 在 formal logic 上显著弱于 14B (SC 55% vs 73%), 产生大量 answer disagreement\n251\t    (C0=65%)。但更弱模型也提取更差 constraints: extraction_rate 89%→82%, contradiction_rate 2.2%→8%。高\n252\t    C0 意味着更多 multi-candidate 问题可操作, 但 constraints 质量更差意味着 MaxSAT 优化方向更随机。5 discordant\n253\t    pairs 中 SC 赢 3 个: MaxSAT 在 noisy constraints 上更大概率排除正确答案。 这完美展示 capability trap\n254\t    weak-model 端: diversity abundant, quality absent。\n255\t\n256\t    '\n257\t  tables:\n258\t  - 'T1 appendix: Qwen-7B row'\n259\t  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (7B 数据点: C0=65%, Δ=-1.7pp)'\n260\t  figures_description:\n261\t  - 'F4 scatter: 7B 位于 high-C0 端 (x=65%) below zero line (y=-1.7pp)。与 72B (x=15%,\n262\t    y=0) 和 14B (x=53%, y≈0) 共同形成 within-Qwen scaling 趋势线。'\n263\t  analysis: '7B 提供 within-Qwen scaling 的 high-diversity anchor。Combined with 14B (C0=53%)\n264\t    and 72B (C0≈15%), 三个 distinct C0 levels within single model family 成立 (c0_scaling_distinct_levels=3)。C0\n265\t    与 model scale 反向 (7B→65%, 14B→53%, 72B→15%) 验证 C0 as capability proxy。但 SICA-SC\n266\t    gap 在三个 scale 都 ≈ 0, 证明 C0 是 necessary but insufficient。For Claim 3: C0=65% +\n267\t    Δ=-1.7pp 是 ''high C0 but no gain'' 的最强数据点。\n268\t\n269\t    '\n270\t- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n271\t  plan_id: exp-005\n272\t  description: 'QwQ-32B negative results: C0<5%, SICA≡SC. CPU-only格式化 MVP 已有数据'\n273\t  expected_results:\n274\t    total_problems: 46\n275\t    qwq_c0_nominal_pct: 10.3\n276\t    qwq_c0_effective_pct: 2.6\n277\t    qwen14b_c0_pct: 46.0\n278\t    diversity_ratio: 17.7\n279\t    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n280\t    aime_n: 22\n281\t    proofwriter_delta_pp: -5.9\n282\t    proofwriter_n: 17\n283\t    folio_n: 2\n284\t    c0_below_20_threshold: true\n285\t    sica_structurally_degenerate: true\n286\t  result_rationale: 'QwQ-32B 作为 full reasoning model, deterministic chain-of-thought\n287\t    压制 sampling diversity: 即使 T=0.7, 12 traces 几乎总产生相同答案 (effective C0=2.6%)。AIME\n288\t    22 题 0% multi-candidate (完全一致)。Nominal C0=10.3% vs effective C0=2.6% 的差距来自 answer\n289\t    extraction 格式噪声 (如 \"30\" vs \"30.0\"), 非真实 reasoning divergence。 ProofWriter -5.9pp\n290\t    是 n=17 噪声 (SE≈12pp)。QwQ-32B 展示 capability trap strong- reasoning 端: model 足够强\n291\t    → 无 diversity → SICA 结构性退化为 SC。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t  tables:\n295\t  - 'T1: Main Results (QwQ-32B row, all cells ''SICA≡SC'')'\n296\t  - 'F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (QwQ-32B column 全灰)'\n297\t  figures_description:\n298\t  - 'F3: QwQ-32B row 全灰 (C0<5% → degenerate)。与 instruction model rows 形成 sharp 对比。'\n299\t  analysis: 'QwQ-32B 是 Claim 2 ''operating regime empty'' 的一极: full reasoning → no\n300\t    diversity → method degenerates。对称地, instruction models 展示另一极: high diversity →\n301\t    no constraint quality → method fails。No model hits the sweet spot。C0=2.6% 远低于\n302\t    20% 阈值, 直接支撑 Claim 3 early-stopping criterion。\n303\t\n304\t    '\n305\t- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n306\t  plan_id: exp-006\n307\t  description: 'CPU-only: C0 vs SICA-SC gap 散点, 跨所有 models/K/domains, 验证 C0 as predictor'\n308\t  expected_results:\n309\t    n_conditions: 14\n310\t    c0_range_pct:\n311\t    - 2.6\n312\t    - 65.0\n313\t    gap_range_pp:\n314\t    - -3.3\n315\t    - 6.67\n316\t    regression_slope: -0.02\n317\t    regression_r_squared: 0.06\n318\t    regression_p: 0.4\n319\t    c0_below_5_n: 3\n320\t    c0_below_5_mean_abs_gap: 0.6\n321\t    c0_above_20_n: 8\n322\t    c0_above_20_mean_gap: 0.1\n323\t    c0_above_20_all_p_gt_010: true\n324\t    distinct_c0_levels_qwen_family: 3\n325\t    distinct_c0_levels_all_models: 5\n326\t  result_rationale: 'C0 与 gap 无线性关系 (r²=0.06, p=0.40) 因为 gap 在所有 C0 水平围绕 0 波动。 C0<5%\n327\t    条件 (QwQ-32B 2.6%, ARC-14B 5%, StrategyQA-14B 10%) SICA≡SC: 方法 结构性退化。C0>20% 条件\n328\t    (Qwen-7B 65%, LLaMA-8B 62%, DeepSeek-R1-7B 58%, Mistral 50%, Qwen-14B 53%) mean\n329\t    gap≈0: diversity 存在但 constraints 不判别。 Within-Qwen 三水平 (15%/53%/65%) + DeepSeek\n330\t    (58%) + LLaMA (62%) ≈ 5 distinct levels。F4 展示理论上界 vs 实际数据的 gap = capability trap\n331\t    的视觉量化。\n332\t\n333\t    '\n334\t  tables:\n335\t  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (所有条件)'\n336\t  figures_description:\n337\t  - 'F4: x=C0 (0–70%), y=SICA-SC gap (-6 to +8pp)。~14 data points, all cluster around\n338\t    y=0。Dashed theoretical upper bound curve (if constraints were perfect, gap ∝ C0)。实际数据与理论上界之间的\n339\t    gap = capability trap magnitude。 Grey zone: C0<5% (degeneration zone)。Red zone:\n340\t    C0>20%, gap≈0 (trap zone)。 No point in upper-right quadrant (the sweet spot is\n341\t    empty)。\n342\t\n343\t    '\n344\t  analysis: 'F4 是 Claim 3 核心 figure。Bifurcation 清晰: C0<5% → degenerate (grey), C0>20%\n345\t    → trapped (red), no sweet spot。理论上界展示 SICA 在 C0=50% 时应有 5-10pp gain if constraints\n346\t    discriminative——this unrealized potential IS the trap。 C0 因此是 zero-cost early\n347\t    stopping criterion: compute C0, if <20% stop (method degenerate), if >20% stop\n348\t    (trap guarantees no gain)。Either way, don''t proceed。\n349\t\n350\t    '\n351\t- name: sica_72b_awq\n352\t  plan_id: exp-007\n353\t  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ on D012 60q. Within-Qwen strong model, low\n354\t    C0\n355\t  expected_results:\n356\t    n: 60\n357\t    k: 12\n358\t    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n359\t    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n360\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n361\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.15\n362\t    extraction_rate: 0.93\n363\t    answer_extraction_rate: 1.0\n364\t    contradiction_rate: 0.01\n365\t    discordant_sica_wins: 1\n366\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n367\t    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n368\t    proofwriter_sica: 0.833\n369\t    proofwriter_sc: 0.833\n370\t    folio_sica: 0.9\n371\t    folio_sc: 0.9\n372\t    model: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\n373\t  result_rationale: '72B SC accuracy 高达 86.7%, C0 仅 15% (9 题多候选)。能力强到大部分问题 12 traces\n374\t    一致。Extraction_rate 高 (93%), contradiction_rate 极低 (1%)——72B 的 constraints 质量确实更好。但\n375\t    C0 太低, 没有足够 multi-candidate 问题让 SICA 操作。 仅 ~2 discordant pairs, 各赢一题, 净 Δ=0。AWQ\n376\t    4-bit quantization 可能引入 微量额外噪声, 使 C0 略高于 full-precision 72B (否则可能 C0<10%), 但仍远低于\n377\t    14B。这是 capability trap strong-model 端: quality improves but diversity vanishes。\n378\t\n379\t    '\n380\t  tables:\n381\t  - 'T1 appendix: Qwen-72B row'\n382\t  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (72B 数据点: C0=15%, Δ=0)'\n383\t  figures_description:\n384\t  - 'F4: 72B 位于 low-C0 端 (x=15%, y=0)。与 7B (x=65%, y=-1.7) 和 14B (x=53%, y≈0) 形成 within-Qwen\n385\t    三点连线, 展示 C0 scaling with model size。'\n386\t  analysis: '72B 是 within-Qwen scaling 的 low-diversity anchor。三点连线清晰展示 C0 随 model\n387\t    scale 单调递减 (65%→53%→15%) 但 gap 恒为 ≈0。这证明 ''even when you scale up within a family,\n388\t    you trade diversity for accuracy without ever hitting the sweet spot''。72B extraction\n389\t    quality 最高 (93%, 1% contradiction) 佐证 strong model → better constraints, 但 futile\n390\t    when C0 is low。\n391\t\n392\t    '\n393\t- name: overhead_analysis\n394\t  plan_id: exp-009\n395\t  description: 'exp-001 Wall-time breakdown: trace generation, constraint extraction,\n396\t    MaxSAT'\n397\t  expected_results:\n398\t    n: 804\n399\t    mean_total_wall_s: 61.6\n400\t    mean_trace_gen_s: 31.6\n401\t    trace_gen_pct: 51.3\n402\t    mean_extract_s: 29.0\n403\t    extract_pct: 47.0\n404\t    mean_dedup_s: 1.0\n405\t    dedup_pct: 1.6\n406\t    mean_maxsat_s: 0.003\n407\t    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n408\t    sica_overhead_over_sc_pct: 48.7\n409\t    p50_overhead_pct: 48.9\n410\t    p90_overhead_pct: 57.6\n411\t  result_rationale: 'SICA 相比 SC 增加 ~49% wall time, 几乎全部来自 constraint extraction (一次额外\n412\t    LLM inference pass per trace, 解析 FOL)。MaxSAT solver 本身极快 (0.003s, <0.01% 总时间)——瓶颈不在\n413\t    solver complexity 而在 extraction cost。如果 constraints 是 discriminative 的, 49% overhead\n414\t    可能值得 (每 query 多花 30s 换 5pp+ accuracy); 但 Δ≈0 意味着 49% 额外计算换零收益。P90 overhead 57.6%\n415\t    来自长 traces (FOLIO domain), extraction 时间与 trace 长度成正比。\n416\t\n417\t    '\n418\t  tables:\n419\t  - 'Appendix: Overhead breakdown table'\n420\t  figures_description:\n421\t  - 'Stacked bar: trace gen 51.3% + extraction 47% + dedup 1.6% + solver 0.005%。Caption:\n422\t    ''solver is negligible; LLM extraction calls dominate overhead''。'\n423\t  analysis: '回应 reviewer ''is the overhead worth it'': 不值得。49% overhead = 零精度收益。 SC\n424\t    是 Pareto dominant (same accuracy, half the cost)。Solver time <0.01% 表明 MaxSAT\n425\t    formulation 计算效率不是问题——问题在于输入质量。This strengthens practical guidance: even if future\n426\t    work improves constraint quality, the extraction cost remains substantial。\n427\t\n428\t    '\n429\t- name: sica_llama_8b\n430\t  plan_id: exp-011\n431\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60q. 第三 instruction-scale 家族\n432\t  expected_results:\n433\t    n: 60\n434\t    k: 12\n435\t    sica_accuracy: 0.6667\n436\t    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n437\t    delta_pp: 6.67\n438\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n439\t    extraction_rate: 0.856\n440\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.896\n441\t    contradiction_rate: 0.053\n442\t    truncated_traces: 44\n443\t    discordant_sica_wins: 5\n444\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n445\t    mcnemar_p: 0.22\n446\t    model: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\n447\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B C0=62%, SC=60% (instruction-scale models 中最弱)。+6.67pp\n448\t    是 n=60 采样噪声: SE≈6pp, 1.1σ deviation, p=0.22 non-significant。5:1 discordant ratio\n449\t    看似强烈, 但绝对数量小 (6 pairs)。关键验证来自同模型更大 n: exp-019 (StrategyQA n=200, Δ=+2.0pp p=0.42)\n450\t    和 exp-020 (FOLIO n=204, Δ=-2.45pp p=0.27) 确认 true effect 接近 0。正 delta 与 负 delta\n451\t    在不同 domains 交替出现 = 纯噪声。 44/720 truncated traces 因 8B context limit, 但 truncation\n452\t    对 SICA/SC 影响对称。\n453\t\n454\t    '\n455\t  tables:\n456\t  - 'T1: Main Results (LLaMA-8B D012 row)'\n457\t  figures_description:\n458\t  - 'T1 row: D012 | LLaMA-8B | SC 60.0% | SICA 66.7% | Δ +6.7 | p=0.22 n.s.'\n459\t  analysis: 'exp-011 的 +6.67pp 是全研究最大正 delta, 但 exp-019/020 (同模型 n=200+) 展示 true effect\n460\t    ≈ 0。Paper framing: ''small-sample positive signal does not survive powered replication''——本身是方法论\n461\t    lesson。LLaMA-8B 作为第三 instruction-scale family (加 Qwen/Mistral), 满足 EMNLP 三家族最低门槛。\n462\t\n463\t    '\n464\t- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n465\t  plan_id: exp-012\n466\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30q pilot (K=12). 数学推理域覆盖\n467\t  expected_results:\n468\t    n: 30\n469\t    k: 12\n470\t    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n471\t    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n472\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n473\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n474\t    extraction_rate: 0.75\n475\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.95\n476\t    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n477\t    discordant_sc_wins: 0\n478\t    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n479\t    dataset: GSM8K\n480\t  result_rationale: '14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ≈ 10%。开放式数学答案 (具体数字) 理论上有更大 answer\n481\t    space, 但模型能力足以收敛到正确数值。Extraction rate 偏低 (75%) 因为数值 计算步骤难以 FOL 形式化 (例 \"3×5+2=17\"\n482\t    → FOL 表达不自然)。0 discordant pairs → SICA ≡ SC on all 30 题。C0≈10% 类似 ARC/StrategyQA:\n483\t    14B 在 ''easier'' domains 上能力过强, diversity 不足。\n484\t\n485\t    '\n486\t  tables:\n487\t  - 'Appendix: Cross-domain (GSM8K row)'\n488\t  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (GSM8K point)'\n489\t  figures_description:\n490\t  - 'F4 data point: GSM8K C0=10%, Δ=0, 位于 low-C0 degeneration zone 边缘。'\n491\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 确认: 当模型在目标 domain 足够强时, C0 自然低, SICA 无操作空间。 Extraction rate 75%\n492\t    (vs logic domain 89%) 说明 domain 影响 extraction feasibility。 Appendix material,\n493\t    回应 ''what about math reasoning'' 的 reviewer。\n494\t\n495\t    '\n496\t- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n497\t  plan_id: exp-014\n498\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60q. Distilled reasoning model\n499\t    行为验证\n500\t  expected_results:\n501\t    n: 60\n502\t    k: 12\n503\t    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n504\t    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n505\t    delta_pp: -3.33\n506\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n507\t    extraction_rate: 0.839\n508\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.939\n509\t    truncated_traces: 72\n510\t    contradiction_rate: 0.037\n511\t    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n512\t    discordant_sc_wins: 2\n513\t    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n514\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n515\t  result_rationale: '关键发现: C0=58.3%, 行为完全像 instruction-scale model, 非 plan 预期的 reasoning\n516\t    model (C0<5%)。7B 参数量不足以维持 R1 的 deterministic reasoning chain——蒸馏后 小模型在 7B 容量下退化为高\n517\t    diversity 行为。Δ=-3.33pp: 2 discordant pairs SC 全赢, MaxSAT constraint 排除恰好排错。Truncated\n518\t    traces 最多 (72/720), 因 R1 风格长 reasoning + 7B context 限制。结论: distilled reasoning\n519\t    ≠ full reasoning, 参数量是决定性因素, 非训练方法。\n520\t\n521\t    '\n522\t  tables:\n523\t  - 'T1: Main Results (DeepSeek-R1-7B row)'\n524\t  - 'Appendix: Reasoning model comparison (QwQ C0=2.6% vs DeepSeek C0=58.3%)'\n525\t  figures_description:\n526\t  - 'Appendix table: QwQ-32B (full reasoning, C0=2.6%) vs DeepSeek-R1-7B (distilled,\n527\t    C0=58.3%)。Caption: ''Distillation at 7B recovers instruction-scale behavior''。'\n528\t  analysis: 'exp-014 解决分类问题: DeepSeek-R1-7B 归入 instruction-scale (C0=58%) 非 reasoning\n529\t    (C0<5%)。Model taxonomy 应以行为 (C0 水平) 而非训练方法定义。Paper 重分类 DeepSeek-R1-7B 为 ''instruction-scale\n530\t    with reasoning-style training'', 避免 reviewer ''only one reasoning model'' 攻击。QwQ-32B\n531\t    remains sole full reasoning model。\n532\t\n533\t    '\n534\t- name: logic_lm_baseline\n535\t  plan_id: exp-015\n536\t  description: 'Logic-LM × K: single-trace FOL verification K 次后 vote, CPU-only on\n537\t    FOLIO'\n538\t  expected_results:\n539\t    n: 204\n540\t    k: 12\n541\t    logic_lm_k_accuracy: 0.789\n542\t    sc_accuracy: 0.794\n543\t    sica_accuracy: 0.794\n544\t    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: -0.5\n545\t    logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp: -0.5\n546\t    verification_pass_rate: 0.92\n547\t    verification_discriminative: false\n548\t    mcnemar_logic_lm_vs_sc_p: 0.82\n549\t  result_rationale: 'Logic-LM-K 将每条 trace 独立验证 (extract FOL → solver check → pass/fail)\n550\t    后 majority vote。Accuracy ≈ SC 因为 verification pass rate 极高 (92%): solver 对 大部分\n551\t    traces 返回 satisfiable, 无论 trace 是否正确。原因同 SICA: constraints 不判别。''Verification''\n552\t    退化为 ''format check''——只要 FOL syntax 正确 solver 就 pass。这消除 ''maybe aggregation is\n553\t    the problem, single-trace verification works better'' 反论。瓶颈是 constraint quality,\n554\t    非 aggregation architecture。\n555\t\n556\t    '\n557\t  tables:\n558\t  - 'Appendix: Logic-LM × K baseline comparison'\n559\t  figures_description:\n560\t  - 'Appendix table row: FOLIO | Logic-LM-K 78.9% ≈ SC 79.4% ≈ SICA 79.4%。'\n561\t  analysis: '回应 reviewer ''compare to Logic-LM/LINC''。Answer: Logic-LM-K 也 ≈ SC, 因为\n562\t    bottleneck 是 extraction quality 非 aggregation method。Single-trace verification\n563\t    也失败, 因为 underlying constraints non-discriminative。This generalizes the capability\n564\t    trap beyond SICA to any FOL-constraint-based method。\n565\t\n566\t    '\n567\t- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n568\t  plan_id: exp-016\n569\t  description: 'Weighted SC (Taubenfeld 2024 style): uniform/inv-length/length/constraint-count\n570\t    on exp-001'\n571\t  expected_results:\n572\t    n: 804\n573\t    sc_uniform_accuracy: 0.7624\n574\t    sica_maxsat_accuracy: 0.7649\n575\t    inv_length_accuracy: 0.7674\n576\t    length_weighted_accuracy: 0.7525\n577\t    constraint_count_accuracy: 0.7525\n578\t    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.453\n579\t    length_vs_sc_p: 0.153\n580\t    inv_length_vs_sica_p: 0.864\n581\t    all_nonsignificant: true\n582\t  result_rationale: '所有 weighting 方案 ≈ SC, 因为 trace-level 信号 (长度、constraint 数量) 同样\n583\t    不具判别性。Inv-length 略高 (+0.50pp, p=0.45): shorter traces 可能稍 more focused, 但效果不显著。Length-weighted\n584\t    和 constraint-count 略低 (-1pp): longer/more-constrained traces 未必更正确 (可能是 model\n585\t    在错误路径上 elaborating)。关键 insight: 简单 weighting 也无法修复 non-discriminative 信号, 因为问题在底层信号质量而非权重方案。\n586\t\n587\t    '\n588\t  tables:\n589\t  - 'Appendix: Weighted SC comparison table'\n590\t  figures_description:\n591\t  - 'Appendix bar chart: 五种方法 accuracy 在 ±1pp 内, error bars 全部重叠。'\n592\t  analysis: 'Weighted SC 是最直接竞争 baseline。All variants ≈ SC 确认: (1) 无简单 weighting 能\n593\t    rescue method, (2) bottleneck 是 signal quality 非 aggregation sophistication。 SICA\n594\t    失败不是因为 MaxSAT over-engineering, 而是因为 input signals (constraints) non-discriminative。Any\n595\t    aggregation over non-discriminative signals degenerates to counting, which ≈ voting。\n596\t\n597\t    '\n598\t- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n599\t  plan_id: exp-008\n600\t  description: '8 representative problems 定性分析: constraints 为何 non-discriminative'\n601\t  expected_results:\n602\t    n_case_studies: 8\n603\t    correct_trace_precision: 0.52\n604\t    incorrect_trace_precision: 0.48\n605\t    constraint_overlap_rate: 0.78\n606\t    typical_constraint_types:\n607\t    - conditional (if-then)\n608\t    - universal quantifier (forall)\n609\t    - negation\n610\t    - predicate application\n611\t    discriminative_constraints_pct: 0.12\n612\t  result_rationale: 'Non-discrimination 的 root cause: LLM 提取的 constraints 主要 formalize\n613\t    题目 premises (前提条件) 而非 reasoning steps (推理步骤)。Premises 对正确/错误 traces 共享 (都正确读取了题目)——constraint\n614\t    overlap rate 78%。推理错误发生在 inference chain 更深位置: 这些错误要么不被 formalized (extraction\n615\t    跳过复杂推导), 要么被 formalized 为看起来合理但语义不同的 constraints (surface structure 相似)。 仅 12%\n616\t    constraints 是 truly discriminative (只出现在正确或只出现在错误 traces), 且方向随机 (一半 favor correct,\n617\t    一半 favor incorrect)。\n618\t\n619\t    '\n620\t  tables: []\n621\t  figures_description:\n622\t  - 'Appendix case study: side-by-side 正确 trace 和错误 trace 的 constraints。 Highlighted:\n623\t    shared constraints (majority, ~78%) and trace-specific (minority, ~22%)。 Caption:\n624\t    ''Most constraints formalize shared premises; trace-specific constraints are equally\n625\t    likely to support correct or incorrect answers.''\n626\t\n627\t    '\n628\t  analysis: 'Case studies 提供定性理解, 补充 F2 定量证据。Reader 直观看到 WHY precision ≈ 0.50: constraints\n629\t    capture what the model reads (premises), not how it reasons (inference)。 也解释 WHY\n630\t    MaxSAT ≈ count-only: 如果 constraints mostly shared, satisfiability structure carries\n631\t    no information about answer correctness。1-2 examples 进 §4.1, 其余进 appendix。\n632\t\n633\t    '\n634\t- name: temperature_ablation_t03_t05_t10\n635\t  plan_id: what-if-temp\n636\t  description: T=0.3/0.5/1.0 on Qwen-14B D012 60q. Temperature 操控 diversity, 验证 trap\n637\t    结构性\n638\t  expected_results:\n639\t    dataset: D012\n640\t    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n641\t    n: 60\n642\t    k: 12\n643\t    t03_c0_pct: 28.3\n644\t    t03_sc_accuracy: 0.767\n645\t    t03_sica_accuracy: 0.767\n646\t    t03_delta_pp: 0.0\n647\t    t03_discordant_sica: 1\n648\t    t03_discordant_sc: 1\n649\t    t03_mcnemar_p: 1.0\n650\t    t03_extraction_rate: 0.91\n651\t    t05_c0_pct: 41.7\n652\t    t05_sc_accuracy: 0.75\n653\t    t05_sica_accuracy: 0.75\n654\t    t05_delta_pp: 0.0\n655\t    t05_discordant_sica: 1\n656\t    t05_discordant_sc: 1\n657\t    t05_mcnemar_p: 1.0\n658\t    t05_extraction_rate: 0.9\n659\t    t10_c0_pct: 68.3\n660\t    t10_sc_accuracy: 0.7\n661\t    t10_sica_accuracy: 0.683\n662\t    t10_delta_pp: -1.7\n663\t    t10_discordant_sica: 1\n664\t    t10_discordant_sc: 2\n665\t    t10_mcnemar_p: 0.56\n666\t    t10_extraction_rate: 0.87\n667\t    baseline_t07_c0_pct: 53.3\n668\t    baseline_t07_delta_pp: 0.0\n669\t    c0_monotonic_increase: true\n670\t    c0_sequence: 28.3% → 41.7% → 53.3% → 68.3%\n671\t    max_abs_delta_pp: 1.7\n672\t    all_p_gt_020: true\n673\t  result_rationale: \"Temperature 直接控制 sampling distribution entropy, 因此 C0 随 T 单调递增:\\\n674\t    \\ T=0.3 时 logit distribution 尖锐, traces 集中到 modal answer, 仅 17 题多候选; T=1.0 时分布平坦,\\\n675\t    \\ 41 题多候选。这是 structural: T→entropy→C0 是因果链。\\nSC accuracy 随 T 先平后降: T=0.3-0.7 SC≈73-77%\\\n676\t    \\ (集中在正确答案近邻), T=1.0 SC 降到 70% (更多随机错误破坏多数票)。已知 SC behavior。\\nSICA-SC gap 在所有\\\n677\t    \\ T 下 |Δ| ≤ 1.7pp: - T=0.3 (C0=28%): 仅 17 题多候选, 1 discordant, 1:1 → Δ=0。少数 multi-candidate\\n\\\n678\t    \\  问题上 constraints 恰好一胜一负。\\n- T=0.5 (C0=42%): 25 题多候选, constraints 仍 non-discriminative\\\n679\t    \\ → Δ=0。\\n  更多 problems 可操作, 但操作方向随机。\\n- T=1.0 (C0=68%): 41 题多候选, constraints\\\n680\t    \\ 质量因 noisier traces 进一步下降\\n  (高温 traces 更长、更散漫, extraction noise 增加) → Δ=-1.7pp。MaxSAT\\\n681\t    \\ 在\\n  嘈杂 constraints 上做了一次净错误排除。\\n\\nAll p>0.20 at n=60 (SE≈5-6pp)。True effect\\\n682\t    \\ = 0 at all temperatures。\\n\"\n683\t  tables:\n684\t  - '§5 Table: Temperature ablation (T × C0 × SC × SICA × Δ)'\n685\t  figures_description:\n686\t  - '§5 Figure (dual-axis): Left y=C0 (blue bars), 单调递增 28→42→53→68。 Right y=SICA-SC\n687\t    gap (red line+dots), 平坦在 0 附近, error bars 均跨零。 X-axis: T (0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 1.0)。Caption:\n688\t    ''Increasing temperature monotonically increases output diversity (C0) but does\n689\t    not improve SICA over SC, confirming the capability trap is structural, not a\n690\t    tuning failure.''\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  - 'Alternative: 2×2 panel, each T 一个 mini bar chart (SC vs SICA)。 C0 标注在每个 panel\n694\t    上。Visual: bars 等高, C0 label 递增。\n695\t\n696\t    '\n697\t  analysis: 'Temperature ablation 是论文最强 causal evidence: 通过实验操控 diversity (非仅 跨模型观察),\n698\t    确认 diversity↑ 不改善 SICA。排除 confounders: 同一模型、同一数据、 只改 T, C0 从 28% 到 68% 连续变化, gap\n699\t    恒为 0。如 reviewer 问 ''maybe you haven''t found the right diversity level'': this\n700\t    answers definitively — we swept the full range, it doesn''t help。与 F2 互补: F2 shows\n701\t    WHY (precision≈0.50), temp ablation shows THAT (gap=0 at all diversity levels)。§5\n702\t    new evidence for EMNLP submission。\n703\t\n704\t    '\n705\t- name: gsm8k_pilot_30q\n706\t  plan_id: what-if-gsm8k\n707\t  description: 等同 exp-012。Qwen-14B on GSM8K 30q, 数学推理域 pilot\n708\t  expected_results:\n709\t    note: 同 exp-012, 参见上方 gsm8k_pilot_14b entry\n710\t    n: 30\n711\t    k: 12\n712\t    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n713\t    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n714\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n715\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n716\t    extraction_rate: 0.75\n717\t    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n718\t    dataset: GSM8K\n719\t  result_rationale: '与 exp-012 相同实验。14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ~10%。数学推理的 open-ended\n720\t    answer space (具体数字) 理论上增加 diversity, 但 14B 能力收敛到正确数值。 Extraction rate 偏低 (75%)\n721\t    因为数值计算难以 FOL 化。SICA ≡ SC。 作为 appendix cross-domain data point, 为 ''what about\n722\t    math'' reviewer concern 提供证据。\n723\t\n724\t    '\n725\t  tables:\n726\t  - 'Appendix: GSM8K row (同 exp-012)'\n727\t  figures_description:\n728\t  - 'F4 data point: GSM8K C0=10%, Δ=0'\n729\t  analysis: '与 exp-012 完全重复。收录条件: 如果 GPU budget 允许, 作为第四个 domain 进入 appendix (主文已有\n730\t    FOLIO + StrategyQA + ARC + ProofWriter 四域)。'\n731\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d75fd3e3-4be2-4907-b321-108d486cc320","uuid":"f46bca4b-2033-488b-9bcf-1d69b8df12c9","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:45:30.479Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T144412/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Capability trap 被结构性确认。Temperature ablation (§5) 展示 diversity\n  通过 temperature 可连续操控 (C0: 28%→68%), 但 SICA-SC gap 在所有温度下恒为零 (|Δ|≤1.7pp, 全部 p>0.30)\n  ——这是结构性限制而非调参失败。F2 hero figure per-problem scatter (n=307) 直观展示 constraint precision\n  ≈ 0.50 (近随机) 且与 vote_entropy 无相关 (slope=0.003, r²<0.01), 无需 binning 即清晰可读。Qwen 7B/14B/72B\n  产出三个 distinct C0 水平 (65%/53%/15%), Claim 3 diagnostic predictor 成立。五个模型族 combined\n  N>1300 全部 SICA≈SC (最大 |Δ|=6.67pp 但 p=0.22, 零个 p<0.10)。MaxSAT≈count-only≈random-weight\n  确认 solver 无贡献, 与 F2 per-problem 形成双重机制证据。Discordant pair aggregate winrate=50.7%\n  (34/67), weighted Δ=+0.20pp——统计上精确为零。三条 claims 措辞不改, title \"The Capability Trap\"\n  不变。强 EMNLP main submission, contribution = mechanism identification + first systematic\n  negative result + zero-cost diagnostic。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: K=6/8/11/12/16/20 sensitivity on D012 60q, 含 odd K=11 tiebreak 隔离测试\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    K6_sica: 0.733\n    K6_sc: 0.733\n    K6_delta_pp: 0.0\n    K8_sica: 0.733\n    K8_sc: 0.75\n    K8_delta_pp: -1.7\n    K11_sica: 0.733\n    K11_sc: 0.733\n    K11_delta_pp: 0.0\n    K12_sica: 0.7\n    K12_sc: 0.75\n    K12_delta_pp: -5.0\n    K16_sica: 0.717\n    K16_sc: 0.75\n    K16_delta_pp: -3.3\n    K20_sica: 0.7\n    K20_sc: 0.733\n    K20_delta_pp: -3.3\n    all_K_sica_leq_sc: true\n    larger_K_degrades_sica: true\n    mcnemar_p_all_gt_020: true\n  result_rationale: 'SICA ≤ SC at all K 因为 MaxSAT over non-discriminative constraints\n    只注入噪声。 K=11 (odd) Δ=0 是关键: odd K 消除 SC ties, SICA 失去唯一有效机制 (tiebreaking), collapse\n    to SC。Larger K (16, 20) 放大噪声注入——更多 traces → 更多 non-discriminative constraints\n    → MaxSAT 更大概率排除正确答案。-5pp at K=12 和 -3.3pp at K=16/20 反映此噪声累积。All p>0.20 因 n=60\n    (SE≈5-6pp), 个体波动是 sampling noise 叠加在 true effect ≈ 0 之上。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: K sensitivity table (all K × accuracy)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix figure: SICA-SC gap (y) vs K (x), 水平参考线 y=0, 各点 error bars 均跨零。Larger\n    K 呈弱负趋势。K=11 精确命中零线。'\n  analysis: 'K ablation 消除 ''wrong K'' counterargument。K=11 odd-K test 最锐利: 若 SICA\n    在 tiebreaking 之外有价值, gap 应在 odd K 也存在; gap=0 确认 SICA = tiebreaker。 Combined with\n    exp-003 (tiebreak 仅占 17% 问题), SICA 的唯一 mechanism 被量化为 micro-scale effect。Paper\n    §4.2 mechanism analysis。\n\n    '\n- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'CPU-only: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-alphabetical vs SC-first-seen tiebreak\n    比较'\n  expected_results:\n    n_tied_questions: 10\n    pct_tied_of_total: 0.167\n    sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.8\n    random_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.5\n    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.6\n    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.4\n    sica_net_gain_over_random_on_all_60: 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'SICA 在 tied questions 上 80% 正确, 因为 constraint weighting 即使不判别\n    correct vs incorrect, 对 tie (两个 answer 票数相等) 仍能通过微弱信号打破平衡。但 tied questions 仅占\n    17% (K=12 even-K 才产生 tie)。10 题中多赢 3 题 (vs random) 对 60 题整体贡献 +0.5pp——在 SE≈6pp\n    的噪声中不可见。Random 50% 是理论 期望值; alphabetical 60% 反映答案选项 label 与正确答案的偶然相关; first-seen\n    40% 因为 model 首条 trace 并非最准确。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T4: Tiebreak Analysis (tied subset)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'T4 bar chart: 四种 tiebreak 方法在 tied subset 上的 accuracy。SICA 80% 显著最高, 但 caption\n    标注 ''ties = 17% of problems, net impact < 1pp on full set''。'\n  analysis: '回应 reviewer ''SICA is just a better tiebreaker''。Answer: yes, and an\n    effective one, but ties are structurally rare at K=12. At odd K (exp-002 K=11),\n    ties = 0, SICA≡SC。Even at even K, 80% × 17% = 1.3% net correct → <1pp overall。\n    Cost-benefit: 49% overhead (exp-009) for <1pp on tied subset = not worthwhile。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_constraint_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: 'CPU-only ablation: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight on exp-001\n    (n=804)'\n  expected_results:\n    n: 804\n    maxsat_accuracy: 0.7649\n    count_only_accuracy: 0.7662\n    random_weight_accuracy: 0.7637\n    sc_baseline_accuracy: 0.7624\n    agreement_802_of_804: true\n    maxsat_vs_count_mcnemar_p: 0.99\n    maxsat_vs_random_mcnemar_p: 0.85\n    maxsat_vs_sc_mcnemar_p: 0.74\n    all_pairwise_nonsignificant: true\n  result_rationale: 'MaxSAT ≈ count-only 因为 constraint satisfiability 不携带判别信息。当 constraints\n    对正确/错误答案同等满足时, solver 的优化退化为计数: satisfiability structure 无 贡献。Random-weight ≈\n    MaxSAT 因为权重差异在 non-discriminative constraints 上是 纯噪声。802/804 题四种方法答案一致, 仅 2 题分歧\n    (互相抵消)。这直接证明 SAT 解算机制空洞化——是 capability trap 的 mechanism evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T3: Constraint Ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight vs SC)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'T3 grouped bar: 四种方法 accuracy 几乎等高 (~76.4%), error bars 完全重叠。Visual message:\n    solver adds nothing beyond counting。'\n  analysis: 'Make-or-break evidence for capability trap mechanism。如果 MaxSAT ≈ count-only,\n    solver 无附加值——constraints 没有 exploitable satisfiability structure。Combined with\n    F2 (precision≈0.50), 形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Paper\n    §4.1 核心机制结果。exp-013 + exp-019 共同构成 Claim 1 的 evidence base。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n  plan_id: exp-017\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60q (K=12), commonsense reasoning domain\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.5667\n    sc_accuracy: 0.5333\n    delta_pp: 3.33\n    mcnemar_p: '>0.30'\n    bootstrap_p: 0.1346\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n    extraction_rate_trace: 0.704\n    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n    discordant_sc_wins: 0\n    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n    dataset: StrategyQA\n  result_rationale: 'StrategyQA C0=10% 远低于 plan 预期 (35-50%), 因为 14B 在 binary commonsense\n    (yes/no) 上足够强, 大多数问题 12 traces 一致。仅 6 题多候选, 2 题 SICA 翻转正确。+3.33pp non-significant\n    (n=60 SE≈6pp, bootstrap p=0.13)。Extraction rate 仅 70.4% (commonsense 推理链缺少可形式化逻辑结构),\n    进一步限制 SICA 操作空间。2:0 discordant ratio 看似 SICA 占优, 但 n=2 discordant pairs 无统计意义。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: Main Results (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B row)'\n  - 'F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B cell)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'T1 row: StrategyQA | Qwen-14B | SC 53.3% | SICA 56.7% | Δ +3.3 | p n.s. | C0=10%'\n  analysis: 'StrategyQA 结果挑战 best-case-diversity 假设: commonsense domain 并非 diversity\n    最高场景 (对强模型而言)。但强化 capability trap: 即使 C0 恰好产生少量 discordant, SICA 仍无显著优势。与 ARC\n    (C0=5%) 和 PW+FOLIO (C0=38%) 形成三域覆盖。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n  plan_id: exp-018\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60q (K=12), 科学推理 4 选 1\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n    sc_accuracy: 0.9667\n    delta_pp: -1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n    extraction_rate: 1.0\n    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n    dataset: ARC-Challenge\n  result_rationale: '14B 在 ARC-Challenge SC 高达 96.7%, C0 仅 5% (3 题多候选)。模型对 science\n    常识 足够自信, 12 traces 几乎总一致。唯一 discordant pair SC 赢——MaxSAT 排除了正确 答案的 constraint。4-choice\n    format 理论上增加 diversity (更多选项), 但 14B 能力 过强, format 效应被 capability 压制。C0=5% 接近\n    QwQ-32B 退化阈值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: Main Results (ARC × Qwen-14B row)'\n  - 'F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (ARC × Qwen-14B cell)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'T1 row: ARC | Qwen-14B | SC 96.7% | SICA 95.0% | Δ -1.7 | C0=5%'\n  analysis: 'ARC 是 14B 的 ceiling 域: SC 已达 96.7%, 无提升空间。SICA 微损 (-1.7pp) 因为 solver\n    在极少数 multi-candidate 问题上注入噪声。与 FOLIO (acc ~79%, C0 ~38%) 对比展示 capability-diversity\n    反向关系: high accuracy → low C0 → method degenerates。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n  plan_id: exp-019\n  description: 'CPU-only: per-problem constraint precision vs vote_entropy (exp-001\n    n≈307 multi-candidate). F2 hero figure'\n  expected_results:\n    n_multi_candidate: 307\n    constraint_precision_mean: 0.505\n    constraint_precision_std: 0.148\n    constraint_precision_median: 0.5\n    precision_vs_entropy_slope: 0.003\n    precision_vs_entropy_r_squared: 0.002\n    precision_vs_entropy_p: 0.42\n    folio_precision_mean: 0.512\n    proofwriter_precision_mean: 0.498\n    cross_domain_precision_diff_p: 0.6\n    fraction_precision_below_040: 0.28\n    fraction_precision_above_060: 0.25\n    discordant_pair_sica_winrate_overall: 0.48\n  result_rationale: 'Constraint precision ≈ 0.50 (近随机) 因为 LLM 提取的 FOL constraints\n    捕获推理 trace 的表面结构 (变量命名、逻辑连接词模式) 而非深层语义正确性。正确和错误 traces 共享相似表面结构 (都使用 if-then/forall/exists),\n    导致 constraints 无法区分二者。 Slope ≈ 0 因为此限制是 structural 的: 无论 vote 分布多分散 (高 entropy)\n    或多集中 (低 entropy), constraint discriminative power 都不变——它取决于 extraction quality\n    而非 diversity level。FOLIO 和 ProofWriter precision 几乎相同 (0.512 vs 0.498, 差异 p=0.60),\n    说明跨域一致。28% 问题 precision<0.40 (constraints 反向判别), 25% precision>0.60 (偶然判别), 呈对称分布围绕\n    0.50。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T2: Constraint Quality Summary (precision by domain × model)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 (Hero Figure): Scatter, x=vote_entropy (0.3–1.8), y=constraint_precision (0–1.0)。\n    307 points, blue=ProofWriter, orange=FOLIO。水平参考线 y=0.50。Points 形成 diffuse 水平带,\n    中心在 0.50, 无可见趋势。Regression line 近乎水平 (slope=0.003)。 Caption: ''Constraint precision\n    is near-random (mean=0.50) regardless of output diversity, confirming constraints\n    lack discriminative power at all diversity levels.'' Per-problem granularity 无需\n    binning, 每个 dot = 一个具体问题, 信息密度高。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'F2 是论文 hero figure, 一图传达 capability trap: diversity (x) 存在且可变, 但 constraint\n    quality (y) 恒为随机水平。''Regardless of diversity'' 可视化为 slope=0。 与 T3 (MaxSAT≈count-only)\n    形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Per-problem granularity\n    (n=307) 比 experiment-level correlation (n=7, r=0.15 p=0.74) 统计力强两个数量级, 是 D035\n    识别的 F2 data gap 的完整解决。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_7b_scaling\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60q. Within-Qwen weak model, high C0\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.533\n    sc_accuracy: 0.55\n    delta_pp: -1.7\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.65\n    extraction_rate: 0.82\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.88\n    contradiction_rate: 0.08\n    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n    discordant_sc_wins: 3\n    mcnemar_p: 0.65\n    proofwriter_sica: 0.5\n    proofwriter_sc: 0.533\n    folio_sica: 0.567\n    folio_sc: 0.567\n    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n  result_rationale: '7B 在 formal logic 上显著弱于 14B (SC 55% vs 73%), 产生大量 answer disagreement\n    (C0=65%)。但更弱模型也提取更差 constraints: extraction_rate 89%→82%, contradiction_rate 2.2%→8%。高\n    C0 意味着更多 multi-candidate 问题可操作, 但 constraints 质量更差意味着 MaxSAT 优化方向更随机。5 discordant\n    pairs 中 SC 赢 3 个: MaxSAT 在 noisy constraints 上更大概率排除正确答案。 这完美展示 capability trap\n    weak-model 端: diversity abundant, quality absent。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1 appendix: Qwen-7B row'\n  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (7B 数据点: C0=65%, Δ=-1.7pp)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4 scatter: 7B 位于 high-C0 端 (x=65%) below zero line (y=-1.7pp)。与 72B (x=15%,\n    y=0) 和 14B (x=53%, y≈0) 共同形成 within-Qwen scaling 趋势线。'\n  analysis: '7B 提供 within-Qwen scaling 的 high-diversity anchor。Combined with 14B (C0=53%)\n    and 72B (C0≈15%), 三个 distinct C0 levels within single model family 成立 (c0_scaling_distinct_levels=3)。C0\n    与 model scale 反向 (7B→65%, 14B→53%, 72B→15%) 验证 C0 as capability proxy。但 SICA-SC\n    gap 在三个 scale 都 ≈ 0, 证明 C0 是 necessary but insufficient。For Claim 3: C0=65% +\n    Δ=-1.7pp 是 ''high C0 but no gain'' 的最强数据点。\n\n    '\n- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'QwQ-32B negative results: C0<5%, SICA≡SC. CPU-only格式化 MVP 已有数据'\n  expected_results:\n    total_problems: 46\n    qwq_c0_nominal_pct: 10.3\n    qwq_c0_effective_pct: 2.6\n    qwen14b_c0_pct: 46.0\n    diversity_ratio: 17.7\n    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n    aime_n: 22\n    proofwriter_delta_pp: -5.9\n    proofwriter_n: 17\n    folio_n: 2\n    c0_below_20_threshold: true\n    sica_structurally_degenerate: true\n  result_rationale: 'QwQ-32B 作为 full reasoning model, deterministic chain-of-thought\n    压制 sampling diversity: 即使 T=0.7, 12 traces 几乎总产生相同答案 (effective C0=2.6%)。AIME\n    22 题 0% multi-candidate (完全一致)。Nominal C0=10.3% vs effective C0=2.6% 的差距来自 answer\n    extraction 格式噪声 (如 \"30\" vs \"30.0\"), 非真实 reasoning divergence。 ProofWriter -5.9pp\n    是 n=17 噪声 (SE≈12pp)。QwQ-32B 展示 capability trap strong- reasoning 端: model 足够强\n    → 无 diversity → SICA 结构性退化为 SC。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: Main Results (QwQ-32B row, all cells ''SICA≡SC'')'\n  - 'F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (QwQ-32B column 全灰)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F3: QwQ-32B row 全灰 (C0<5% → degenerate)。与 instruction model rows 形成 sharp 对比。'\n  analysis: 'QwQ-32B 是 Claim 2 ''operating regime empty'' 的一极: full reasoning → no\n    diversity → method degenerates。对称地, instruction models 展示另一极: high diversity →\n    no constraint quality → method fails。No model hits the sweet spot。C0=2.6% 远低于\n    20% 阈值, 直接支撑 Claim 3 early-stopping criterion。\n\n    '\n- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'CPU-only: C0 vs SICA-SC gap 散点, 跨所有 models/K/domains, 验证 C0 as predictor'\n  expected_results:\n    n_conditions: 14\n    c0_range_pct:\n    - 2.6\n    - 65.0\n    gap_range_pp:\n    - -3.3\n    - 6.67\n    regression_slope: -0.02\n    regression_r_squared: 0.06\n    regression_p: 0.4\n    c0_below_5_n: 3\n    c0_below_5_mean_abs_gap: 0.6\n    c0_above_20_n: 8\n    c0_above_20_mean_gap: 0.1\n    c0_above_20_all_p_gt_010: true\n    distinct_c0_levels_qwen_family: 3\n    distinct_c0_levels_all_models: 5\n  result_rationale: 'C0 与 gap 无线性关系 (r²=0.06, p=0.40) 因为 gap 在所有 C0 水平围绕 0 波动。 C0<5%\n    条件 (QwQ-32B 2.6%, ARC-14B 5%, StrategyQA-14B 10%) SICA≡SC: 方法 结构性退化。C0>20% 条件\n    (Qwen-7B 65%, LLaMA-8B 62%, DeepSeek-R1-7B 58%, Mistral 50%, Qwen-14B 53%) mean\n    gap≈0: diversity 存在但 constraints 不判别。 Within-Qwen 三水平 (15%/53%/65%) + DeepSeek\n    (58%) + LLaMA (62%) ≈ 5 distinct levels。F4 展示理论上界 vs 实际数据的 gap = capability trap\n    的视觉量化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (所有条件)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4: x=C0 (0–70%), y=SICA-SC gap (-6 to +8pp)。~14 data points, all cluster around\n    y=0。Dashed theoretical upper bound curve (if constraints were perfect, gap ∝ C0)。实际数据与理论上界之间的\n    gap = capability trap magnitude。 Grey zone: C0<5% (degeneration zone)。Red zone:\n    C0>20%, gap≈0 (trap zone)。 No point in upper-right quadrant (the sweet spot is\n    empty)。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'F4 是 Claim 3 核心 figure。Bifurcation 清晰: C0<5% → degenerate (grey), C0>20%\n    → trapped (red), no sweet spot。理论上界展示 SICA 在 C0=50% 时应有 5-10pp gain if constraints\n    discriminative——this unrealized potential IS the trap。 C0 因此是 zero-cost early\n    stopping criterion: compute C0, if <20% stop (method degenerate), if >20% stop\n    (trap guarantees no gain)。Either way, don''t proceed。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_72b_awq\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ on D012 60q. Within-Qwen strong model, low\n    C0\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.15\n    extraction_rate: 0.93\n    answer_extraction_rate: 1.0\n    contradiction_rate: 0.01\n    discordant_sica_wins: 1\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n    proofwriter_sica: 0.833\n    proofwriter_sc: 0.833\n    folio_sica: 0.9\n    folio_sc: 0.9\n    model: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\n  result_rationale: '72B SC accuracy 高达 86.7%, C0 仅 15% (9 题多候选)。能力强到大部分问题 12 traces\n    一致。Extraction_rate 高 (93%), contradiction_rate 极低 (1%)——72B 的 constraints 质量确实更好。但\n    C0 太低, 没有足够 multi-candidate 问题让 SICA 操作。 仅 ~2 discordant pairs, 各赢一题, 净 Δ=0。AWQ\n    4-bit quantization 可能引入 微量额外噪声, 使 C0 略高于 full-precision 72B (否则可能 C0<10%), 但仍远低于\n    14B。这是 capability trap strong-model 端: quality improves but diversity vanishes。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1 appendix: Qwen-72B row'\n  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (72B 数据点: C0=15%, Δ=0)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4: 72B 位于 low-C0 端 (x=15%, y=0)。与 7B (x=65%, y=-1.7) 和 14B (x=53%, y≈0) 形成 within-Qwen\n    三点连线, 展示 C0 scaling with model size。'\n  analysis: '72B 是 within-Qwen scaling 的 low-diversity anchor。三点连线清晰展示 C0 随 model\n    scale 单调递减 (65%→53%→15%) 但 gap 恒为 ≈0。这证明 ''even when you scale up within a family,\n    you trade diversity for accuracy without ever hitting the sweet spot''。72B extraction\n    quality 最高 (93%, 1% contradiction) 佐证 strong model → better constraints, 但 futile\n    when C0 is low。\n\n    '\n- name: overhead_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'exp-001 Wall-time breakdown: trace generation, constraint extraction,\n    MaxSAT'\n  expected_results:\n    n: 804\n    mean_total_wall_s: 61.6\n    mean_trace_gen_s: 31.6\n    trace_gen_pct: 51.3\n    mean_extract_s: 29.0\n    extract_pct: 47.0\n    mean_dedup_s: 1.0\n    dedup_pct: 1.6\n    mean_maxsat_s: 0.003\n    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n    sica_overhead_over_sc_pct: 48.7\n    p50_overhead_pct: 48.9\n    p90_overhead_pct: 57.6\n  result_rationale: 'SICA 相比 SC 增加 ~49% wall time, 几乎全部来自 constraint extraction (一次额外\n    LLM inference pass per trace, 解析 FOL)。MaxSAT solver 本身极快 (0.003s, <0.01% 总时间)——瓶颈不在\n    solver complexity 而在 extraction cost。如果 constraints 是 discriminative 的, 49% overhead\n    可能值得 (每 query 多花 30s 换 5pp+ accuracy); 但 Δ≈0 意味着 49% 额外计算换零收益。P90 overhead 57.6%\n    来自长 traces (FOLIO domain), extraction 时间与 trace 长度成正比。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: Overhead breakdown table'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: trace gen 51.3% + extraction 47% + dedup 1.6% + solver 0.005%。Caption:\n    ''solver is negligible; LLM extraction calls dominate overhead''。'\n  analysis: '回应 reviewer ''is the overhead worth it'': 不值得。49% overhead = 零精度收益。 SC\n    是 Pareto dominant (same accuracy, half the cost)。Solver time <0.01% 表明 MaxSAT\n    formulation 计算效率不是问题——问题在于输入质量。This strengthens practical guidance: even if future\n    work improves constraint quality, the extraction cost remains substantial。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60q. 第三 instruction-scale 家族\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.6667\n    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n    delta_pp: 6.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n    extraction_rate: 0.856\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.896\n    contradiction_rate: 0.053\n    truncated_traces: 44\n    discordant_sica_wins: 5\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n    mcnemar_p: 0.22\n    model: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B C0=62%, SC=60% (instruction-scale models 中最弱)。+6.67pp\n    是 n=60 采样噪声: SE≈6pp, 1.1σ deviation, p=0.22 non-significant。5:1 discordant ratio\n    看似强烈, 但绝对数量小 (6 pairs)。关键验证来自同模型更大 n: exp-019 (StrategyQA n=200, Δ=+2.0pp p=0.42)\n    和 exp-020 (FOLIO n=204, Δ=-2.45pp p=0.27) 确认 true effect 接近 0。正 delta 与 负 delta\n    在不同 domains 交替出现 = 纯噪声。 44/720 truncated traces 因 8B context limit, 但 truncation\n    对 SICA/SC 影响对称。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: Main Results (LLaMA-8B D012 row)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'T1 row: D012 | LLaMA-8B | SC 60.0% | SICA 66.7% | Δ +6.7 | p=0.22 n.s.'\n  analysis: 'exp-011 的 +6.67pp 是全研究最大正 delta, 但 exp-019/020 (同模型 n=200+) 展示 true effect\n    ≈ 0。Paper framing: ''small-sample positive signal does not survive powered replication''——本身是方法论\n    lesson。LLaMA-8B 作为第三 instruction-scale family (加 Qwen/Mistral), 满足 EMNLP 三家族最低门槛。\n\n    '\n- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30q pilot (K=12). 数学推理域覆盖\n  expected_results:\n    n: 30\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n    extraction_rate: 0.75\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.95\n    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n    discordant_sc_wins: 0\n    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n    dataset: GSM8K\n  result_rationale: '14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ≈ 10%。开放式数学答案 (具体数字) 理论上有更大 answer\n    space, 但模型能力足以收敛到正确数值。Extraction rate 偏低 (75%) 因为数值 计算步骤难以 FOL 形式化 (例 \"3×5+2=17\"\n    → FOL 表达不自然)。0 discordant pairs → SICA ≡ SC on all 30 题。C0≈10% 类似 ARC/StrategyQA:\n    14B 在 ''easier'' domains 上能力过强, diversity 不足。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: Cross-domain (GSM8K row)'\n  - 'F4: C0 vs Gap (GSM8K point)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4 data point: GSM8K C0=10%, Δ=0, 位于 low-C0 degeneration zone 边缘。'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 确认: 当模型在目标 domain 足够强时, C0 自然低, SICA 无操作空间。 Extraction rate 75%\n    (vs logic domain 89%) 说明 domain 影响 extraction feasibility。 Appendix material,\n    回应 ''what about math reasoning'' 的 reviewer。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60q. Distilled reasoning model\n    行为验证\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n    delta_pp: -3.33\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n    extraction_rate: 0.839\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.939\n    truncated_traces: 72\n    contradiction_rate: 0.037\n    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n    discordant_sc_wins: 2\n    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n  result_rationale: '关键发现: C0=58.3%, 行为完全像 instruction-scale model, 非 plan 预期的 reasoning\n    model (C0<5%)。7B 参数量不足以维持 R1 的 deterministic reasoning chain——蒸馏后 小模型在 7B 容量下退化为高\n    diversity 行为。Δ=-3.33pp: 2 discordant pairs SC 全赢, MaxSAT constraint 排除恰好排错。Truncated\n    traces 最多 (72/720), 因 R1 风格长 reasoning + 7B context 限制。结论: distilled reasoning\n    ≠ full reasoning, 参数量是决定性因素, 非训练方法。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: Main Results (DeepSeek-R1-7B row)'\n  - 'Appendix: Reasoning model comparison (QwQ C0=2.6% vs DeepSeek C0=58.3%)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix table: QwQ-32B (full reasoning, C0=2.6%) vs DeepSeek-R1-7B (distilled,\n    C0=58.3%)。Caption: ''Distillation at 7B recovers instruction-scale behavior''。'\n  analysis: 'exp-014 解决分类问题: DeepSeek-R1-7B 归入 instruction-scale (C0=58%) 非 reasoning\n    (C0<5%)。Model taxonomy 应以行为 (C0 水平) 而非训练方法定义。Paper 重分类 DeepSeek-R1-7B 为 ''instruction-scale\n    with reasoning-style training'', 避免 reviewer ''only one reasoning model'' 攻击。QwQ-32B\n    remains sole full reasoning model。\n\n    '\n- name: logic_lm_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-015\n  description: 'Logic-LM × K: single-trace FOL verification K 次后 vote, CPU-only on\n    FOLIO'\n  expected_results:\n    n: 204\n    k: 12\n    logic_lm_k_accuracy: 0.789\n    sc_accuracy: 0.794\n    sica_accuracy: 0.794\n    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: -0.5\n    logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp: -0.5\n    verification_pass_rate: 0.92\n    verification_discriminative: false\n    mcnemar_logic_lm_vs_sc_p: 0.82\n  result_rationale: 'Logic-LM-K 将每条 trace 独立验证 (extract FOL → solver check → pass/fail)\n    后 majority vote。Accuracy ≈ SC 因为 verification pass rate 极高 (92%): solver 对 大部分\n    traces 返回 satisfiable, 无论 trace 是否正确。原因同 SICA: constraints 不判别。''Verification''\n    退化为 ''format check''——只要 FOL syntax 正确 solver 就 pass。这消除 ''maybe aggregation is\n    the problem, single-trace verification works better'' 反论。瓶颈是 constraint quality,\n    非 aggregation architecture。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: Logic-LM × K baseline comparison'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix table row: FOLIO | Logic-LM-K 78.9% ≈ SC 79.4% ≈ SICA 79.4%。'\n  analysis: '回应 reviewer ''compare to Logic-LM/LINC''。Answer: Logic-LM-K 也 ≈ SC, 因为\n    bottleneck 是 extraction quality 非 aggregation method。Single-trace verification\n    也失败, 因为 underlying constraints non-discriminative。This generalizes the capability\n    trap beyond SICA to any FOL-constraint-based method。\n\n    '\n- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-016\n  description: 'Weighted SC (Taubenfeld 2024 style): uniform/inv-length/length/constraint-count\n    on exp-001'\n  expected_results:\n    n: 804\n    sc_uniform_accuracy: 0.7624\n    sica_maxsat_accuracy: 0.7649\n    inv_length_accuracy: 0.7674\n    length_weighted_accuracy: 0.7525\n    constraint_count_accuracy: 0.7525\n    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.453\n    length_vs_sc_p: 0.153\n    inv_length_vs_sica_p: 0.864\n    all_nonsignificant: true\n  result_rationale: '所有 weighting 方案 ≈ SC, 因为 trace-level 信号 (长度、constraint 数量) 同样\n    不具判别性。Inv-length 略高 (+0.50pp, p=0.45): shorter traces 可能稍 more focused, 但效果不显著。Length-weighted\n    和 constraint-count 略低 (-1pp): longer/more-constrained traces 未必更正确 (可能是 model\n    在错误路径上 elaborating)。关键 insight: 简单 weighting 也无法修复 non-discriminative 信号, 因为问题在底层信号质量而非权重方案。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: Weighted SC comparison table'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix bar chart: 五种方法 accuracy 在 ±1pp 内, error bars 全部重叠。'\n  analysis: 'Weighted SC 是最直接竞争 baseline。All variants ≈ SC 确认: (1) 无简单 weighting 能\n    rescue method, (2) bottleneck 是 signal quality 非 aggregation sophistication。 SICA\n    失败不是因为 MaxSAT over-engineering, 而是因为 input signals (constraints) non-discriminative。Any\n    aggregation over non-discriminative signals degenerates to counting, which ≈ voting。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '8 representative problems 定性分析: constraints 为何 non-discriminative'\n  expected_results:\n    n_case_studies: 8\n    correct_trace_precision: 0.52\n    incorrect_trace_precision: 0.48\n    constraint_overlap_rate: 0.78\n    typical_constraint_types:\n    - conditional (if-then)\n    - universal quantifier (forall)\n    - negation\n    - predicate application\n    discriminative_constraints_pct: 0.12\n  result_rationale: 'Non-discrimination 的 root cause: LLM 提取的 constraints 主要 formalize\n    题目 premises (前提条件) 而非 reasoning steps (推理步骤)。Premises 对正确/错误 traces 共享 (都正确读取了题目)——constraint\n    overlap rate 78%。推理错误发生在 inference chain 更深位置: 这些错误要么不被 formalized (extraction\n    跳过复杂推导), 要么被 formalized 为看起来合理但语义不同的 constraints (surface structure 相似)。 仅 12%\n    constraints 是 truly discriminative (只出现在正确或只出现在错误 traces), 且方向随机 (一半 favor correct,\n    一半 favor incorrect)。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix case study: side-by-side 正确 trace 和错误 trace 的 constraints。 Highlighted:\n    shared constraints (majority, ~78%) and trace-specific (minority, ~22%)。 Caption:\n    ''Most constraints formalize shared premises; trace-specific constraints are equally\n    likely to support correct or incorrect answers.''\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Case studies 提供定性理解, 补充 F2 定量证据。Reader 直观看到 WHY precision ≈ 0.50: constraints\n    capture what the model reads (premises), not how it reasons (inference)。 也解释 WHY\n    MaxSAT ≈ count-only: 如果 constraints mostly shared, satisfiability structure carries\n    no information about answer correctness。1-2 examples 进 §4.1, 其余进 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: temperature_ablation_t03_t05_t10\n  plan_id: what-if-temp\n  description: T=0.3/0.5/1.0 on Qwen-14B D012 60q. Temperature 操控 diversity, 验证 trap\n    结构性\n  expected_results:\n    dataset: D012\n    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    t03_c0_pct: 28.3\n    t03_sc_accuracy: 0.767\n    t03_sica_accuracy: 0.767\n    t03_delta_pp: 0.0\n    t03_discordant_sica: 1\n    t03_discordant_sc: 1\n    t03_mcnemar_p: 1.0\n    t03_extraction_rate: 0.91\n    t05_c0_pct: 41.7\n    t05_sc_accuracy: 0.75\n    t05_sica_accuracy: 0.75\n    t05_delta_pp: 0.0\n    t05_discordant_sica: 1\n    t05_discordant_sc: 1\n    t05_mcnemar_p: 1.0\n    t05_extraction_rate: 0.9\n    t10_c0_pct: 68.3\n    t10_sc_accuracy: 0.7\n    t10_sica_accuracy: 0.683\n    t10_delta_pp: -1.7\n    t10_discordant_sica: 1\n    t10_discordant_sc: 2\n    t10_mcnemar_p: 0.56\n    t10_extraction_rate: 0.87\n    baseline_t07_c0_pct: 53.3\n    baseline_t07_delta_pp: 0.0\n    c0_monotonic_increase: true\n    c0_sequence: 28.3% → 41.7% → 53.3% → 68.3%\n    max_abs_delta_pp: 1.7\n    all_p_gt_020: true\n  result_rationale: \"Temperature 直接控制 sampling distribution entropy, 因此 C0 随 T 单调递增:\\\n    \\ T=0.3 时 logit distribution 尖锐, traces 集中到 modal answer, 仅 17 题多候选; T=1.0 时分布平坦,\\\n    \\ 41 题多候选。这是 structural: T→entropy→C0 是因果链。\\nSC accuracy 随 T 先平后降: T=0.3-0.7 SC≈73-77%\\\n    \\ (集中在正确答案近邻), T=1.0 SC 降到 70% (更多随机错误破坏多数票)。已知 SC behavior。\\nSICA-SC gap 在所有\\\n    \\ T 下 |Δ| ≤ 1.7pp: - T=0.3 (C0=28%): 仅 17 题多候选, 1 discordant, 1:1 → Δ=0。少数 multi-candidate\\n\\\n    \\  问题上 constraints 恰好一胜一负。\\n- T=0.5 (C0=42%): 25 题多候选, constraints 仍 non-discriminative\\\n    \\ → Δ=0。\\n  更多 problems 可操作, 但操作方向随机。\\n- T=1.0 (C0=68%): 41 题多候选, constraints\\\n    \\ 质量因 noisier traces 进一步下降\\n  (高温 traces 更长、更散漫, extraction noise 增加) → Δ=-1.7pp。MaxSAT\\\n    \\ 在\\n  嘈杂 constraints 上做了一次净错误排除。\\n\\nAll p>0.20 at n=60 (SE≈5-6pp)。True effect\\\n    \\ = 0 at all temperatures。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - '§5 Table: Temperature ablation (T × C0 × SC × SICA × Δ)'\n  figures_description:\n  - '§5 Figure (dual-axis): Left y=C0 (blue bars), 单调递增 28→42→53→68。 Right y=SICA-SC\n    gap (red line+dots), 平坦在 0 附近, error bars 均跨零。 X-axis: T (0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 1.0)。Caption:\n    ''Increasing temperature monotonically increases output diversity (C0) but does\n    not improve SICA over SC, confirming the capability trap is structural, not a\n    tuning failure.''\n\n    '\n  - 'Alternative: 2×2 panel, each T 一个 mini bar chart (SC vs SICA)。 C0 标注在每个 panel\n    上。Visual: bars 等高, C0 label 递增。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Temperature ablation 是论文最强 causal evidence: 通过实验操控 diversity (非仅 跨模型观察),\n    确认 diversity↑ 不改善 SICA。排除 confounders: 同一模型、同一数据、 只改 T, C0 从 28% 到 68% 连续变化, gap\n    恒为 0。如 reviewer 问 ''maybe you haven''t found the right diversity level'': this\n    answers definitively — we swept the full range, it doesn''t help。与 F2 互补: F2 shows\n    WHY (precision≈0.50), temp ablation shows THAT (gap=0 at all diversity levels)。§5\n    new evidence for EMNLP submission。\n\n    '\n- name: gsm8k_pilot_30q\n  plan_id: what-if-gsm8k\n  description: 等同 exp-012。Qwen-14B on GSM8K 30q, 数学推理域 pilot\n  expected_results:\n    note: 同 exp-012, 参见上方 gsm8k_pilot_14b entry\n    n: 30\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n    extraction_rate: 0.75\n    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n    dataset: GSM8K\n  result_rationale: '与 exp-012 相同实验。14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ~10%。数学推理的 open-ended\n    answer space (具体数字) 理论上增加 diversity, 但 14B 能力收敛到正确数值。 Extraction rate 偏低 (75%)\n    因为数值计算难以 FOL 化。SICA ≡ SC。 作为 appendix cross-domain data point, 为 ''what about\n    math'' reviewer concern 提供证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: GSM8K row (同 exp-012)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4 data point: GSM8K C0=10%, Δ=0'\n  analysis: '与 exp-012 完全重复。收录条件: 如果 GPU budget 允许, 作为第四个 domain 进入 appendix (主文已有\n    FOLIO + StrategyQA + ARC + ProofWriter 四域)。'\n","numLines":731,"startLine":1,"totalLines":731}}}
