{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016NZhnR2pHvuomL3ufTNAVH","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# symb_invariant_consensus — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-17 11:29 UTC | 更新原因: D035: exp-020 确认 SICA≤SC，Operating Regime 死亡，进入写作阶段\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**D025 Capability Trap Analysis Paper (FINAL)**：SICA ≈ SC everywhere。Symbolic consensus 因 diversity-quality 反向相关而失效。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research → Writing transition（D035 确认最终方向）+ 审稿进行中\\\\n- **关键结论 (D035)**:\\\\n  - 四个 powered test 全部 negative: exp-001 +0.25pp n.s., exp-010 0.0pp, exp-019 +2.0pp p=0.424, exp-020 -2.4pp\\\\n  - exp-013: MaxSAT ≈ count-only（mechanism vacuous）\\\\n  - exp-002: SICA ≤ SC all K including odd K=11（tiebreak-only）\\\\n  - exp-011 +10pp 是 n=30 噪声（exp-020 同任务 n=204 反转为 -2.4pp）\\\\n- **已完成实验**: exp-001/002/010/011/013/017/018/019/020 (9 个核心实验)\\\\n- **Plan 覆盖**: 19 实验中 9 个 done，剩余多为 CPU ablation\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务（按优先级排序）\\\\n- [ ] exp-009: overhead analysis（CPU，P1，论文必需）\\\\n- [ ] exp-015: Logic-LM baseline（CPU，P1，Reviewer concern #9）\\\\n- [ ] exp-016: weighted SC baseline（CPU，P1，Reviewer concern #10）\\\\n- [ ] exp-014: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B（GPU ~2h，第二个 reasoning model）\\\\n- [ ] exp-019 plan: constraint quality correlation 分析（CPU，hero figure F2 数据）\\\\n- [ ] dream_simulate(review_mode=\\\\\\\"full\\\\\\\") 验证 framing\\\\n- [ ] 启动 Paper Agent 写作\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 1× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB (cuda:0) on westd-32608\\\\n- 当前: **空闲**（exp-020 已完成）\\\\n- 剩余 GPU 实验: exp-014 (~2h), exp-004 (~2h), exp-007 (~4h) — 按优先级排\\\\n- 累计已用: ~24h\\\\n\\\\n## 阻塞项\\\\n- 无硬阻塞。CPU ablations 可立即并行启动。ARR May 25 还剩 8 天。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-17 | D036: Manage